import{_ as i,o,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 324 | Perfect-World Decomposition (Overview): Shi Hao's Solitary Dao and Single-Log Civilization Typology","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 324 | Perfect-World Decomposition (Overview): Shi Hao's Solitary Dao and Single-Log Civilization Typology","no":324,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Perfect World","Shi Hao","Desolate Heaven Emperor","Single-Log Civilization","Overview"],"related":["17-Plane Transcendent Standards","04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","03-Symbiotic Civilization Charter"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0324_模块2-完美世界-石昊孤道与独木式文明定性.md","filePath":"en/0324_模块2-完美世界-石昊孤道与独木式文明定性.md"}`),a={name:"en/0324_模块2-完美世界-石昊孤道与独木式文明定性.md"};function r(s,e,l,d,c,u){return o(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-324-perfect-world-decomposition-overview-shi-hao-s-solitary-dao-and-single-log-civilization-typology" tabindex="-1">Entry 324 | Perfect-World Decomposition (Overview): Shi Hao&#39;s Solitary Dao and Single-Log Civilization Typology <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-324-perfect-world-decomposition-overview-shi-hao-s-solitary-dao-and-single-log-civilization-typology" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 324 | Perfect-World Decomposition (Overview): Shi Hao&#39;s Solitary Dao and Single-Log Civilization Typology&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Perfect-World Full Decomposition (Entry 1 · Overview) | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 17, 03</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-shi-hao-did-not-save-an-era-but-bet-a-civilization-on-his-own-shoulders" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Shi Hao did not save an era, but bet a civilization on his own shoulders <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-shi-hao-did-not-save-an-era-but-bet-a-civilization-on-his-own-shoulders" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Shi Hao did not save an era, but bet a civilization on his own shoulders&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Perfect World&#39;s Shi Hao, known to later generations as the Desolate Heaven Emperor, is web literature history&#39;s most tragic and most lonely protagonist. Born with Supreme Bone dug out, youth exiled to Stone Village, taking himself as seed, single-handedly deciding eternity, alone pacifying dark turmoil, holding up for later Shrouding era a sky with no darkness. Heng Yuan Zhou (Wanling Hengmao Origin Universe)&#39;s respect for Shi Hao goes without saying — he was the only one who did not kneel in that dark age. But judging civilization structure, respect must yield to structural analysis: Shi Hao used a lifetime to prove &quot;one person can carry one cosmos,&quot; and precisely proved &quot;one cosmos should not be carried by one person.&quot;</p><p>This entry as the overview of the Perfect-World decomposition series establishes the full judging base — six top-level axioms: anti-predation axiom (develop increments, do not consume stock), republican axiom of Myriad Races (all beings equal evolution qualification), collective ascension axiom (strong ones feed back to Myriad Ranks, no great-material-small-use), causal self-discipline axiom (observe first then limitedly intervene, only transmit knowledge back without disturbing causality), law-first axiom (law precedes, never retcons, setting self-consistency over plot convenience), universal equal infinite law. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Among them the <strong>law-first axiom</strong> is core — Perfect World&#39;s eighteen-layer realm inflation and multi-part crossover retconning are precisely typical lesions of law not preceding. Protagonist uniqueness dependency verdict: <strong>Shi Hao = extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency</strong> — slightly lower than Gu Chensha&#39;s pure single-log, because he once had Stone Village, Liu Shen, Myriad-Realms comrades, but civilization ultimately still rests on his single-handed autocracy; single-log features overwhelm oligarchic remnants.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Shi Hao&#39;s energy is Emperor Immortal tier — one of Myriad-Realms ceilings. But this energy&#39;s direction has extreme waste:</p><ul><li><strong>One-person civilizationization</strong>: pacifying dark turmoil, opening Shrouding era, blocking samsara and weird-source — all done by Shi Hao alone. The civilization engineering Myriad Ranks could have co-built is compressed into one person&#39;s epic</li><li><strong>Comrades idling</strong>: Liu Shen, Cao Yusheng, Myriad-Realms strong ones in long campaigns mostly as foils and sacrifices, not converted into institutionalized civilization-conservation force</li><li><strong>No successor</strong>: after single-handedly deciding eternity, later (Shrouding era) still needs emperors &quot;to suppress darkness one by one,&quot; showing Shi Hao did not precipitate the solution into law and institution</li></ul><p>Holding Emperor Immortal-tier power, the final use is &quot;carrying darkness for Myriad Ranks for a lifetime&quot; — over-great material, over-tragic, also over-wasteful.</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Perfect World&#39;s historical regression is structurally destined:</p><ol><li><strong>Generational break = crisis</strong>: after Shi Hao, Nine Heavens and Ten Earths and Immortal Realm have no equal night-watcher; darkness returns in more covert forms (i.e., Shrouding&#39;s dark turmoil, Sacred Ruins&#39; weirdness)</li><li><strong>Knowledge dies with the person</strong>: the complete self-seed method, the concrete path of single-handedly deciding eternity, not precipitated as &quot;Myriad-Rank public&quot;; later generations can only guess across generations</li><li><strong>Tragedy depends on the individual</strong>: every time darkness comes, it waits for &quot;the next Shi Hao,&quot; rather than starting civilization&#39;s own immune mechanism</li></ol><p>This is more extreme &quot;person present = policy flourishes&quot; than Shrouding — Shrouding at least has a group of emperors on rotation; Perfect World has no &quot;rotation&quot; at all, only the one Desolate.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Shi Hao&#39;s conduct is noble, never bloodthirsty, but predatory thinking is defined by structure, not malice:</p><ul><li><strong>Resource-exclusive Dao realization</strong>: taking himself as seed though claiming &quot;no need for external seeking,&quot; actually devours massive cave-heavens, divine materials, era fortune; one person&#39;s seed drains one realm&#39;s nutrients</li><li><strong>Opportunity zero-sum exclusion</strong>: Supreme Bone, Crown-All Body, various innate supreme treasures&#39; contention strongly zero-sum</li><li><strong>Dao legacies hidden</strong>: the Emperor Immortal path not opened to Myriad Ranks; later generations cannot even imitate</li></ul><p>Shi Hao is the most tragic &quot;enlightened predator&quot; — he predates not for private enjoyment, but to hold back darkness; but &quot;predating for justice&quot; still bets civilization&#39;s fate on personal morality.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Perfect World Single-Log Order</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Shi Hao alone decides eternity</td><td>Anchor Council + Symbiotic Executive Committee collective night watch</td></tr><tr><td>Dark turmoil suppressed by Emperor Immortal</td><td>Alaya whole-network supervision, Dark Replacement Bodies early-identified and intervened</td></tr><tr><td>Self-seed one-person Dao realization</td><td>300 Origin systems Myriad-Rank co-build, 20% Activation Strategy produces strong ones in waves</td></tr><tr><td>Supreme-Bone-style bloodline monopoly</td><td>Myriad Ranks 99% full coverage, all beings equal evolution qualification</td></tr><tr><td>Generational break = darkness returns</td><td>Law precedes, order written into charter not tied to individuals</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The essence of the alternative: change &quot;the cosmos Shi Hao carries&quot; into &quot;the cosmos Myriad Ranks themselves night-watch.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: Quest Sediment Domain replicates Perfect World law parameters — Blood-Drawing to Emperor Immortal eighteen realms, dark-turmoil cycle, Stone Village and Nine-Heavens-Ten-Earths plane structure</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject three groups of contrasts — &quot;Shi Hao normal autocracy,&quot; &quot;Shi Hao alone fighting dies at dark source,&quot; &quot;Anchor Symbiosis institutions injected&quot;</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: dark-event mortality, civilization knowledge-transmission rate, Myriad-Rank evolution coverage</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: output &quot;Perfect-World Single-Log Structure Collapse Index,&quot; quantifying the long-term civilization cost of &quot;one-person autocracy&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. Early Blood-Drawing, Cave-Heaven, Spirit-Transforming, Inscription Formation, Array-Position layering fine; later Supreme, True Immortal, Immortal King, Emperor Immortal layers inflate; realm count reaches eighteen, combat-power constraints loosen</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: high</strong>. Perfect World and Shrouding, Sacred Ruins multi-part crossover; timeline, samsara line, weird source repeatedly revised; early iron laws overturned late</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency</strong></li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: Emperor Immortal-tier aptitude used for one person&#39;s autocracy over eternity; Myriad-Rank co-building engineering compressed into personal epic</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: self-seed devours one realm&#39;s nutrients, opportunity zero-sum exclusion, Dao legacies hidden not public</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Shi Hao single-log (extreme-leaning-medium) is more extreme than Tang Luo bestowed (high) — he did not even have time to systematically establish &quot;universal benefit&quot; before alone shouldering darkness</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Foreign-Realm Myriad Ranks demonized as &quot;dark&quot;; foreign races, female cultivators mostly foils</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Perfect World&#39;s closed era and zero-sum dark game are far from the infinitely expandable symbiotic cosmos</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Shi Hao was the only one who did not kneel in that dark age; Heng Yuan Zhou salutes him. But saluting does not mean endorsing the structure. A cosmos that needs the Desolate Heaven Emperor alone to carry eternity is itself a failed cosmos — true Myriad Ranks republicanism needs no one to &quot;autocratically decide,&quot; because night watch is everyone&#39;s business.</p><p>In the final analysis, Perfect World · Shi Hao&#39;s solitary Dao and single-log civilization typology described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./325_模块2-完美世界-仙帝级资质用于独断万古.html">Entry 325 · Energy-Level Waste Analysis</a> · <a href="./328_模块2-完美世界-至尊骨被挖事件.html">Entry 328 · Supreme-Bone Dig-Out Incident</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane Transcendent Standards</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const m=i(a,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
